<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Payment Refunded</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px;">

    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">

        <h2 style="color: #0275d8;">Payment Refunded</h2>

        <p>Hi,</p>

        <p>Your payment has been refunded. Here are the details:</p>

        <hr />

        <p><strong>Booking ID:</strong> {{bookingId}}</p>
        <p><strong>Refund Amount:</strong> {{amount}} {{currency}}</p>
        <p><strong>Payment ID:</strong> {{paymentId}}</p>

        <hr />

        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            The refund will be credited to your original payment method within 5-7 business days.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
            Regards,<br/>
            <strong>Haven Booking Team</strong>
        </p>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
